  "body": "I think I raised this before, but I don't really see text about it in the specification. If you limit yourself to UTF-8, you need to deal with cookies that do not decode as UTF-8, presumably by dropping them as Chrome appears to do for `document.cookie`. That should be specified somehow.\r\n\r\nI think that means cookies need to use \"UTF-8 decode without BOM or fail\" from Encoding.",
